# Mobile (`civil-mobile`)

React Native + TypeScript. Same API as web. Follow `project-core` mobile architecture.

```
src/
  features/<feature>/components|screens|hooks
  components/
  navigation/
  services/
  stores/
```

- REST `/api/v1` only — never DB/Redis/Prisma
- Navigation owned by `navigation/`
- Zustand for client/UI state only; local state first
- Secure token storage; never log tokens/PII
